claim.claim-text:
(a) contacting the microorganisms in a fermentation medium with an enzyme under conditions that causes disruption of the microorganisms;
(b) concentrating the disrupted microorganisms from the fermentation medium; and
(c) extracting the oil from the disrupted microorganisms of step (b) at a high temperature and in the absence of an organic solvent, wherein extraction separates the oil from the disrupted microorganisms.
